<body>
  <header>
    <h1>A-Z Fisheries</h1>
    <p>Fighting the invasive Asian carp with innovative mass-harvest solutions</p>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>We're on a mission to remove millions of pounds of invasive Asian carp from Illinois waterways. With new technology and experience, we're ready to take action now — but we need your support.</p>
    
    <h2>Why It Matters</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Asian carp threaten native fish species and ecosystems</li>
      <li>They damage commercial and recreational fisheries</li>
      <li>They’re spreading rapidly and action can’t wait</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Support the Cause</h2>
    <p>We're seeking donations of equipment, funds, and visibility. Every bit counts.</p>
    <p>Contact: <strong>Andrew R. Swan</strong><br/>
    Phone: 217-323-0439<br/>
    Email: swanandy381@gmail.com</p>
  </main>
